  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nAmount after 3 years (A₃) = 10648\n\nAmount after 5 years (A₅) = 12884.08\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nA = P(1 + r/100)t\n\n**Calculations:**\n\n⇒ A₅ / A₃ = (1 + r/100)⁵ / (1 + r/100)³\n\n⇒ 12884.08 / 10648 = (1 + r/100)²\n\n⇒ 1.21 = (1 + r/100)²\n\n⇒ 1.1 = (1 + r/100)\n\n⇒ r = 10%\n\nNow,\n\n10648 = P × (1.1)³\n\n⇒ 10648 = P × 1.331\n\n⇒ P = 10648 ÷ 1.331\n\n⇒ P = 8000\n\n**∴ Required sum = ₹8000**\n\nd4",
